"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3|\n"
"\n"
"Allows you to define service classes for tasks.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"To configure this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to *Project > Configuration > Service Class*, create the classes.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"In a task form you can assign a class in the Service Class field. And in\n"
"the kanban view of a project you can click on *Group By > Service Class*\n"
"and you will see the tasks separated by class.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/KMEE/kmee-odoo-addons/issues>`_.\n"
